OL,5,G0210 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FAs paramedics treat a woman with
OL,7,     Fchest pains, she goes into cardiac
OL,8,     Farrest. A young boy has signs of
OL,9,     Fcroup, and a man's collapsed in a
OL,10,     Fpool of his own vomit.
OL,11,G0310 Grand Designs
OL,12,     FPaul and Amy build a home made up
OL,13,     Fof five circular timber buildings
OL,14,     Flinked by raised walkways, beside
OL,15,     Fa Lincolnshire lake. But Paul's
OL,16,     Fhealth suffers as he struggles to
OL,17,     Ffinish it in a year.
